# CR 506.3b: Leonin Warleader's attack trigger makes two 1/1 lifelink Cats
# "tapped and attacking" (TokenAttacking$ True). TokenEffectBase.java:188 runs
# SpellAbilityEffect.addToCombat for each token: the activator picks the
# defender among combat.getDefenders() and the token attacks it, never having
# been declared (so no Attacks trigger of its own). Both Cats are unblocked
# attackers in the damage step: ai takes 4 + 1 + 1, and human gains 2 from
# lifelink.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
queue attacktarget ai
queue attacktarget ai
resolvestack
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
